Maintainer: Jon <dvbondoy@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: flickos-branding
Architecture: all
Depends: base-files,
         plymouth,
         plymouth-themes,
         plymouth-label,
         fonts-dejavu-core,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: FlickOS branding: logo, boot splash, boot menu, OS name and login banner
 Installs the FlickOS logo icons (flickos, flickos-symbolic) and the FlickOS
 Plymouth boot splash, and makes the splash the default theme.
 .
 Gives the GRUB boot menu FlickOS's theme (/etc/default/grub.d/flickos-theme.cfg
 points update-grub at /usr/share/flickos/grub/).
 .
 Shows "FlickOS" in /etc/os-release (PRETTY_NAME, VARIANT) and on the text
 console login banner (/etc/issue, /etc/issue.net). Debian's originals are
 kept via dpkg-divert and the FlickOS versions are regenerated from them
 whenever base-files is upgraded. ID=debian and all version fields stay
 unchanged, so software that detects Debian keeps working.
